" ghpr setup  3/7 When to use it · work                                                                                  "
"Which git user.email is work for? (optional)           ┌ Preview ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"Repos whose git user.email matches use work, wherever  │Where each profile applies:                                    │"
