"                                                       │  anywhere else → personal (default)                           │"
"›                                                      │                                                               │"
"                                                       │First match wins: --profile, git config ghpr.profile,          │"
"                                                       │directories (longest), email, then the default.                │"
"                                                       │                                                               │"
"                                                       │                                                               │"
"                                                       │                                                               │"
"With neither directories nor an email, work only       │                                                               │"
"applies with `--profile work` or `git config           │                                                               │"
"ghpr.profile work`. Enter keeps it that way; Esc goes  │                                                               │"
